      "filePath": "CNN/nnom-master/examples/rnn-denoise/mfcc.h",
      "summary": "定义MFCC计算上下文的数据结构`mfcc_t`，并声明相关的特征提取API and Mel刻度转换辅助内联函数。",
      "tags": ["type-definition"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
